{"availability":"available","full":"hoangsonww/AI-Gov-Content-Curator","name":"AI-Gov-Content-Curator","description":"💡An end-to-end solution for aggregating, summarizing, and displaying news articles using an AI-powered backend, an automated CRON crawler & newsletter emailer, and a responsive Next.js frontend. It integrates technologies like Express.js, MongoDB, Puppeteer, and GenAI/LLMs to deliver up-to-date, curated content to government staff and other users.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":30,"forks":18,"created":"2025-03-06T01:50:19Z","updated":"2026-10-09T17:29:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://synthoraai.vercel.app","topics":["artificial-intelligence","axios","cheerio","crawler","cron","cronjob","docker","express","expressjs","google-generative-ai","mongodb","mongoose","nextjs","nodejs","puppeteer","react","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://synthoraai.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:05.221Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:05.221Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:05.221Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:05.221Z","stars":30,"forks":18}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SynthoraAI - Synthesizing the world’s news & information through AI. 🚀✨","The SynthoraAI - AI-Powered Article Content Curator is a comprehensive, AI-powered system designed to aggregate, summarize, and present curated government-related articles. This monorepo, multi-services project is organized into seven main components:","High-Level Architecture: Each component is maintained in its own directory:"],"features":["Backend: Provides a robust RESTful API to store and serve curated articles.","Crawler: Automatically crawls and extracts article URLs and metadata from government homepages and public API sources.","Frontend: Offers an intuitive Next.js-based user interface for government staff (and pot